;   the MASK AT 0, which lets the blitter IRQ1 in, and at 0x4b2 it installs 0x1f2a as the level 1
;   handler (the main loop does the same at 0xf216e..0xf2176). When 0x2091ee is set it calls
;   state_advance (0x484); the SR rewrite and the install then run only if 0x20795c is 0. It counts
;   frames at 0x203200/0x2031fc
