; irq1_terminal: TERMINAL level 1 handler, and the other half of the mechanism: it does `andi.w
;   #$f8ff,(A7)` + `ori.w #$2100,(A7)` on the stacked SR, so it leaves the rte with the MASK AT 1,
;   which BLOCKS IRQ1. With that the chain stops by itself until the next vblank, without anyone
;   having to deassert anything
