; palette_range_copy: Copies palette range N of palette_range_table into the buffer at 0x203208: 3
;   bytes per colour from 0x203208 + 3 x start, skipped when N is the one it copied last
;   (re_pal_range_last). It overflows into the display-list cursors at 0x203508 only for an index
;   outside the table, and the one source of such an index is the environment loop at 0xe15f0
;   reading one prop past its array. With that loop corrected no index leaves the table, so a
;   relocation of that buffer is a second guard on the same prototype fault and is not part of the
;   fix (retired 2026-09-24)
