; section_dispatch_table: A table of 45 pointers (0xe5d04..0xe5db7) that ends EXACTLY where the code
;   of init_section_and_dispatch begins (0xe5db8), so an index of 45 or more reads instructions and
;   takes them for pointers. MEASURED per section: section 0 asks for 18 and 0 (valid); section 6
;   asks for 4608, section 9 for 1014, section 10 for -31206, section 12 for 17183 and section 14
;   for 210, and those FIVE are exactly the ones that blow up before drawing the race. The PC ends
;   up in the unmapped gap (measured: 0x11f598) walking straight ahead until a bus fault enters
;   through 0x25a2, which in this game is an rte: it returns to the instruction that faulted and
;   refaults for ever
