; re_snd_stream_src: radendur main. Source of the raster handler that emits the burst, copied to RAM
;   0x203164 (by 0xf2426). It emits 0xA0A0 on iteration 49 and one word of the block on each of the
;   remaining 48, SELF-PATCHING its pointers and erasing what it has sent
; runs from 0x00203164
re_snd_stream_src:
000f243e  33fc0001007a0000      move.w #0x1,(line_counter).l  ; line_counter

; sound_streamer_rom: The sample streamer, in ROM; it is copied to RAM (0x203164) so it can
;   SELF-MODIFY. It sends one sample per line to the subcpu latch and advances its pointer by
;   incrementing the OPERAND of its own instructions (0x20319c and 0x2031a6), 49 firings per block.
;   It touches no register, which saves the whole movem in an interrupt that fires once per line.
;   And that is what makes it fragile: overrunning the pointer corrupts instructions, not data
; runs from 0x0020316c
